### All stocks
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks

### One stock
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks/RELIANCE

### Stocks in one sector
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?sector=Banking

### Add a new stock
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "ZOMATO",
  "name": "Zomato",
  "sector": "Consumer",
  "price": 215.50,
  "description": "Food delivery and quick-commerce platform."
}
